#. Tag: title
#: installation.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalacija"

#. Tag: title
#: installation.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to obtain &ktutorial-editor;"
msgstr "Kako dobiti &ktutorial-editor;"

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ktutorial-editor; is part of KTutorial package, which is hosted at <ulink "
"url=\"http://sourceforge.net/\">SourceForge.net</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"&ktutorial-editor; je dio KTutorial paketa, koji je postavljen na <ulink url="
"\"http://sourceforge.net/\">SourceForge.net</ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"KTutorial can be downloaded from the <ulink url=\"http://sourceforge.net/"
"projects/ktutorial/files/\">files section</ulink> of the <ulink url=\"http://"
"sourceforge.net/projects/ktutorial/\">KTutorial project in SourceForge.net</"
"ulink>."
msgstr ""
"KTutorial može biti preuzet sa <ulink url=\"http://sourceforge.net/projects/"
"ktutorial/files/\">files section</ulink> od <ulink url=\"http://sourceforge."
"net/projects/ktutorial/\">KTutorial projekta u SourceForge.net</ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are encouraged to visit, however, the <ulink url=\"http://ktutorial."
"sourceforge.net/download.html\">download section</ulink> of the <ulink url="
"\"http://ktutorial.sourceforge.net/\">webpage</ulink>, as a lot more "
"information can be found there apart of only the files."
msgstr ""
"Budite potaknuti da posjetite, međutim, <ulink url=\"http://ktutorial."
"sourceforge.net/download.html\"> skinite odjeljak</ulink> of the <ulink url="
"\"http://ktutorial.sourceforge.net/\">webpage</ulink>, kao što i mnogo više "
"informacija može biti pronađeno tamo pored datoteka."

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are brave enough, in the download section you will also find "
"instructions to install KTutorial from <acronym>SVN</acronym>. However, this "
"is only recommended for developers."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste dovoljno hrabri, u odjeljku preuzimanja također ćete pronaći "
"instrukcije za instalaciju KTutorial sa <acronym>SVN</acronym>. Međutim, ovo "
"je jedino preporučljivo za programere."

#. Tag: title
#: installation.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi"

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to successfully build and use KTutorial, you need &kde; (at least "
"version 4.3) and, therefore, &Qt; (at least version 4.6)."
msgstr ""
"Da bi uspješno izgradili i koristili KTutorial, trebate &kde; (najmanje "
"veziju 4.3) i, dakle, &Qt; (najmanje verziju 4.6)."

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use the full feature set of &ktutorial-editor; you will also need the "
"QtDBus module of Qt, only available in Unix systems. Without that module "
"&ktutorial-editor; can not talk to the target application, for example to "
"know the name of its objects."
msgstr ""
"Da bi koristila potpuna svojstva kompletnog &ktutorial-editor; -a, također "
"ćete trebati QtDBus modul Qt-a, jedino dostupnog na Unix sistemima. Bez tog "
"modula &ktutorial-editor;  ne može komunicirati sa ciljnim aplikacijama, "
"naprimjer da zna ime njihovog objekta."

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Also, <application>CMake</application> build system is required to build "
"KTutorial, as required to build any other &kde; application."
msgstr ""
"Također,  <application>CMake</application>izgradbeni sistem je namjenjen da "
"bi gradio KTutorial, kao što je i namjenjen da gradi bilo koje druge &kde;  "
"aplikacije."

#. Tag: title
#: installation.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compilation and Installation"
msgstr "Sastavljanje i instalacija"

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to compile KTutorial on your system, extract the KTutorial package "
"you downloaded and type the following in the base directory of the extracted "
"package:"
msgstr ""
"Da bi kompajlirali  KTutorial na Vašem sistemu, izvucite KTutorial paket "
"koji ste preuzeli i ukucajte naredno u glavni direktorij izvučenog paketa."

#. Tag: screen
#: installation.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput><command>mkdir</command> build &amp;&amp; "
"<command>cd</command> build</userinput>\n"
"<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput><command>cmake</command> ..</userinput>\n"
"<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput><command>make</command></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput><command>mkdir</command> build &amp;&amp; "
"<command>cd</command> build</userinput>\n"
"<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput><command>cmake</command> ..</userinput>\n"
"<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput><command>make</command></userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"That will create a <filename class=\"directory\">build</filename> directory, "
"change to it, prepare the build directory to build KTutorial on it and "
"finally build KTutorial. If <command>cmake</command> complains, you have to "
"install the required dependencies asked in the error message."
msgstr ""
"To će napraviti <filename class=\"directory\">build</filename> direktorij, "
"promijenite na to, pripremite izgradbeni direktorij da bi izgradili "
"KTutorial na njemu i konačno izgradite KTutorial. Ako se <command>cmake</"
"command> žali, morate instalirati preporučene ovisnosti koje su zatražene u "
"poruci greške."

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "To install KTutorial, become root user and run:"
msgstr ""
"Da biste instalirali KTutorial, postanite korijenski korisnik i pokrenite:"

#. Tag: screen
#: installation.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>#</prompt> <userinput><command>make</command> install</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>#</prompt> <userinput><command>make</command> instaliraj</userinput>"

#. Tag: title
#: installation.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Installing &ktutorial-editor; in <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/</"
"filename>"
msgstr ""
"Instaliranje &ktutorial-editor;-a u <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/"
"</filename>"

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to keep a proper organization of your system and not mess up the "
"packages installed by your distribution package manager and those installed "
"manually by you, you are encouraged to install KTutorial in <filename class="
"\"directory\">/usr/local/</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Da bi zadržali pravilnu organizaciju Vašeg sistema i ne bi poremetili pakete "
"instalirane od strane Vašeg menadžera distribucionih paketa i onih "
"instaliranih ručno od strane Vas, budite ohrabreni da instalirate KTutorial "
"u <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the directory that should be used for manually installed packages. "
"To do this, instead of executing <command>cmake</command> as stated before, "
"execute this:"
msgstr ""
"Ovo je direktorij koji treba biti korišten za ručno instalirane pakete. Da "
"bi uradili ovo, umjesto izvršavanja <command>cmake</command> kao što je "
"navedeno ranije, izvršite ovo:"

#. Tag: screen
#: installation.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput><command>cmake</command> <parameter class="
"\"command\">-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/"
"</filename></parameter></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput><command>cmake</command> <parameter class="
"\"command\">-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/"
"</filename></parameter></userinput>"

#. Tag: title
#: installation.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija"

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Depending on your distribution and where KTutorial was installed (if you "
"installed it from sourcecode), you may need a last step before being able to "
"make KTutorial run properly."
msgstr ""
"U zavisnosti od Vaše distribucije i toga gdje je KTutorial instaliran (ako "
"ste ga instalirali iz izvornog koda), možda ćete trebati posljednji korak "
"prije nego bude moguće ispravno pokretanje KTutorial-a."

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To check this, launch &ktutorial-editor; and take a look to the help. If "
"&ktutorial-editor; manual cannot be found, go on reading to know what must "
"be configured. If the manual is shown, congratulations, just enjoy! :)"
msgstr ""
"Da bi provjerili ovo, pokrenite &ktutorial-editor;  i pogledajte pomoć. Ako "
"&ktutorial-editor;  ne može biti ručno pronađen, nastavite čitanje da bi "
"shvatili šta treba biti konfigurisano. Ako je ručno pronađen, čestitamo, "
"samo uživajte! :)"

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the manual wasn't found, you must configure your &kde; prefixes. To do "
"this, create the file <filename>/etc/kderc</filename> and add the following "
"content:"
msgstr ""
"Ako nije pronađen priručnik, morate konfigurisati Vaše  &kde; prefikse. Da "
"bi uradili ovo, napravite datoteku <filename>/etc/kderc</filename> i dodajte "
"naredni sadržaj:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: installation.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"[Directories]\n"
"prefixes=/the/prefix/where/ktutorial/was/installed/"
msgstr ""
"[Directories]\n"
"prefixes=/the/prefix/where/ktutorial/was/installed/"

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If <filename>/etc/kderc</filename> already existed and had a prefixes rule, "
"add the prefix of KTutorial separating it from the previous prefixes with a "
"\",\" like this:"
msgstr ""
"Ako je <filename>/etc/kderc</filename>  već postojao i imao pravilo "
"prefiksa, dodajte prefiks KTutorial-a odvajanjem od prethodnih prefiksa sa "
"\",\" poput ovoga:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: installation.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"[Directories]\n"
"prefixes=/previous/prefixes/,/the/prefix/where/ktutorial/was/installed/"
msgstr ""
"[Directories]\n"
"prefixes=/previous/prefixes/,/the/prefix/where/ktutorial/was/installed/"
